<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %>
<%@ include file="header.jspf" %>
<% String view = String.valueOf(request.getAttribute("view")); List<ServiceRequest> projects = (List<ServiceRequest>)request.getAttribute("projects"); %>
<main id="main">
<% if(request.getAttribute("error") != null){ %><div class="container alert error" role="alert"><strong>Let's fix that.</strong> <%=e(request.getAttribute("error"))%></div><% } %>
<% if(request.getAttribute("flashMessage") != null){ %><div class="container alert success" role="status" <%="published".equals(request.getAttribute("flashKind")) && viewer != null ? "data-published-draft=\"dibsly-project-"+viewer.id()+"\"" : ""%>><%=e(request.getAttribute("flashMessage"))%></div><% } %>

<% if(view.equals("home")){ %>
<section class="home-hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>Big ideas.<br>Meet your<br><em>people.</em></h1><p>Put your next project out there. Let talented freelancers come to you with a plan.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="<%=base%>/<%=viewer == null ? "register?role=CUSTOMER" : viewer.role() == Role.PROVIDER ? "explore" : "app/new"%>">Get your project going <%=arrow()%></a><a class="underlink" href="<%=base%>/explore">I'm here to find work</a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><svg class="icon tiny-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Your brief, your budget, your choice.</div></div>
<div class="hero-board" aria-label="Interactive example of comparing freelance pitches"><div class="board-top"><span>THE COLLABORATION BOARD</span><span class="live-dot">Illustrative example</span></div><div class="sample-brief"><span class="tag">Design & Creative</span><h2>A little brand.<br>A big first impression.</h2><p>A thoughtful identity for a new ceramics studio.</p><div class="brief-bottom"><span>Budget <strong>₹48,000</strong></span><span>Start <strong>This month</strong></span></div></div><div class="pitch-heading"><strong>Two approaches. Your call.</strong><span>Compare a pitch</span></div>
<div class="sample-pitches"><button type="button" class="sample-pitch selected" data-preview="alex" aria-pressed="true"><span class="avatar peach">AM</span><span class="sample-name">Alex Morgan<small>Brand designer</small></span><strong>₹42,000<small>12 days</small></strong></button><button type="button" class="sample-pitch" data-preview="priya" aria-pressed="false"><span class="avatar lilac">PS</span><span class="sample-name">Priya Shah<small>Visual storyteller</small></span><strong>₹46,000<small>10 days</small></strong></button></div>
<div class="preview-detail" aria-live="polite"><span class="detail-mark">“</span><p id="preview-copy">Two visual directions, a considered wordmark, and packaging that feels like you.</p><span id="preview-support">Includes 14 days of post-delivery support</span></div><div class="board-bottom"><span>A clearer way to choose.</span><a href="<%=base%>/how-it-works" aria-label="Learn how pitch comparisons work"><%=arrow()%></a></div></div></section>
<div class="category-ribbon"><div class="container"><span>Good work takes all kinds.</span><a href="<%=base%>/explore?category=Design+%26+Creative">Design</a><a href="<%=base%>/explore?category=Development+%26+IT">Development</a><a href="<%=base%>/explore?category=Writing+%26+Translation">Writing</a><a href="<%=base%>/explore?category=Marketing">Marketing</a><a href="<%=base%>/explore?category=Video+%26+Animation">Video</a></div></div>
<section class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Your next “I'd love<br>to work on that.”</h2><p>Real briefs. Clear budgets. Room for your ideas.</p></div><a class="underlink" href="<%=base%>/explore">Explore all projects <%=arrow()%></a></div><div class="project-grid">
<% for(ServiceRequest p:projects){ %><article class="project-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="tag"><%=e(p.category())%></span><span class="open-indicator">Open</span></div><h3><a href="<%=base%>/project?id=<%=p.id()%>"><%=e(p.title())%></a></h3><p class="clamp"><%=e(p.brief())%></p><div class="card-meta"><span><%=e(p.urgency())%></span><strong><%=money(p.budget())%><small>project budget</small></strong></div></article><% } %>
<% if(projects.isEmpty()){ %><div class="empty-state"><h3>Be the first to start something.</h3><p>Post a clear brief and invite freelancers to pitch.</p><a class="button" href="<%=base%>/register?role=CUSTOMER">Post your first project</a></div><% } %></div></section>
<section class="how-section"><div class="container how-layout"><div><h2>Less searching.<br>More <em>starting.</em></h2><p>You know what you want to make. Find someone who gets it.</p><a class="underlink" href="<%=base%>/how-it-works">Here's how it works <%=arrow()%></a></div><ol class="steps"><li><span>1</span><div><h3>Tell us what you're making.</h3><p>A clear brief, a comfortable budget, and your timeline. That's your starting point.</p></div></li><li><span>2</span><div><h3>Let the right people pitch.</h3><p>Compare the approach, quote, delivery time, and support in each private proposal.</p></div></li><li><span>3</span><div><h3>Pick your person. Get going.</h3><p>Accept the best fit and keep the agreed scope in your shared project record.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="container closing"><h2>That idea you keep<br>thinking about?<em> Start here.</em></h2><a class="button" href="<%=base%>/register">Find your next collaboration <%=arrow()%></a></section>

<% } else if(view.equals("explore")){ String q=(String)request.getAttribute("q"), category=(String)request.getAttribute("category"), sort=(String)request.getAttribute("sort"); int pn=(Integer)request.getAttribute("pageNumber"); %>
<section class="container section"><div class="page-heading"><h1>Find your kind of work.</h1><p>Pick a brief that speaks to you. Bring your own approach.</p></div><form class="search-bar" method="get" action="<%=base%>/explore"><div class="search-field"><label for="q">Search projects</label><input id="q" name="q" value="<%=e(q)%>" placeholder="Try ‘brand identity’ or ‘Java’" maxlength="120" type="search"></div><div><label for="category">Category</label><select id="category" name="category"><option value="">All categories</option><% for(String c:(String[])request.getAttribute("categories")){ %><option <%=c.equals(category)?"selected":""%>><%=e(c)%></option><% } %></select></div><div><label for="sort">Sort by</label><select id="sort" name="sort"><option value="newest">Newest first</option><option value="budget" <%=sort.equals("budget")?"selected":""%>>Highest budget</option></select></div><button type="submit">Find projects <%=arrow()%></button></form><div class="results-heading"><span><%=projects.size()%> projects on this page</span><% if(!q.isEmpty()||!category.isEmpty()){ %><a href="<%=base%>/explore">Clear filters</a><% } %><span>All budgets in INR</span></div><div class="project-grid explore-grid">
<% for(ServiceRequest p:projects){ %><article class="project-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="tag"><%=e(p.category())%></span><span class="open-indicator">Open</span></div><h2><a href="<%=base%>/project?id=<%=p.id()%>"><%=e(p.title())%></a></h2><p class="clamp"><%=e(p.brief())%></p><div class="client-line"><span class="avatar mini"><%=e(p.customerName().substring(0,1))%></span><%=e(p.customerName())%></div><div class="card-meta"><span><%=e(p.urgency())%></span><strong><%=money(p.budget())%><small>project budget</small></strong></div></article><% } %></div>
<% if(projects.isEmpty()){ %><div class="empty-state"><h2>No matching projects yet.</h2><p>Try a broader search or explore another category.</p><a class="button secondary" href="<%=base%>/explore">View all projects</a></div><% } %><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Project pages"><% if(pn>1){ %><a class="button secondary" href="?q=<%=url(q)%>&amp;category=<%=url(category)%>&amp;sort=<%=url(sort)%>&amp;page=<%=pn-1%>">Previous</a><% } %><span>Page <%=pn%></span><% if(Boolean.TRUE.equals(request.getAttribute("hasNext"))){ %><a class="button secondary" href="?q=<%=url(q)%>&amp;category=<%=url(category)%>&amp;sort=<%=url(sort)%>&amp;page=<%=pn+1%>">Next page</a><% } %></nav></section>

<% } else if(view.equals("workspace")){ DashboardStats stats=(DashboardStats)request.getAttribute("stats"); %>
<section class="container section"><div class="workspace-heading"><div><h1>Make good things happen,<br><%=e(viewer.displayName().split(" ")[0])%>.</h1></div><a class="button" href="<%=base%>/<%=viewer.role()==Role.PROVIDER?"explore":"app/new"%>"><%=viewer.role()==Role.PROVIDER?"Find your next project":"Post a project"%> <%=arrow()%></a></div><div class="workspace-stats"><div><strong><%=stats.openRequests()%></strong><span>Open projects</span></div><div><strong><%=stats.proposals()%></strong><span><%=viewer.role()==Role.PROVIDER?"Your pitches":"Pitches received"%></span></div><div><strong><%=stats.bookings()%></strong><span>In progress</span></div><div><strong><%=stats.completed()%></strong><span>Completed</span></div></div><div class="section-heading compact"><h2><%=viewer.role()==Role.PROVIDER?"Your pitches & projects":"Your projects"%></h2><span class="quiet">Most recent 100 projects</span></div><div class="filter-tabs" aria-label="Filter your projects"><button class="active" data-filter="ALL" aria-pressed="true">All projects</button><button data-filter="OPEN" aria-pressed="false">Open</button><button data-filter="BOOKED" aria-pressed="false">In progress</button><button data-filter="COMPLETED" aria-pressed="false">Completed</button><button data-filter="CANCELLED" aria-pressed="false">Closed</button></div><div class="workspace-list">
<% for(ServiceRequest p:projects){ %><article class="workspace-row" data-status="<%=p.status()%>"><span class="project-symbol"><%=e(p.category().substring(0,1))%></span><div><span class="quiet"><%=e(p.category())%></span><h3><a href="<%=base%>/project?id=<%=p.id()%>"><%=e(p.title())%></a></h3><span class="quiet">Start: <%=e(p.urgency())%></span></div><span class="badge <%=p.status().name().toLowerCase()%>"><%=stateLabel(p.status())%></span><strong><%=money(p.budget())%></strong><a class="round-link" href="<%=base%>/project?id=<%=p.id()%>" aria-label="Open <%=e(p.title())%>"><%=arrow()%></a></article><% } %></div><div class="empty-state" id="workspace-empty" <%=projects.isEmpty()?"":"hidden"%>><h3>Your next collaboration starts here.</h3><p>No projects in this view. <%=viewer.role()==Role.PROVIDER?"Explore a brief and send your first pitch.":"Post a brief so freelancers can bring you a plan."%></p><a class="button secondary" href="<%=base%>/<%=viewer.role()==Role.PROVIDER?"explore":"app/new"%>"><%=viewer.role()==Role.PROVIDER?"Explore projects":"Create a project"%></a></div></section>

<% } else if(view.equals("new")){ %>
<section class="container section form-layout"><div class="form-intro"><a class="back-link" href="<%=base%>/app/dashboard">Back to workspace</a><h1>What are<br>you making?</h1><p>A thoughtful brief is the start of a great collaboration.</p><div class="tip-block"><h3>A little clarity goes a long way.</h3><p>Describe the outcome, the deliverables, and what you already have. Leave space for a freelancer's ideas.</p><p>Your brief will be public. Keep passwords, contact details, and confidential files out of it.</p></div></div><form class="editor-form" method="post" action="<%=base%>/app/action/request" data-draft="dibsly-project-<%=viewer.id()%>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=e(token)%>"><h2>Let's get the brief right.</h2><div class="field"><label for="title">Give your project a clear title</label><input id="title" name="title" minlength="8" maxlength="100" required placeholder="e.g. A new brand identity for our coffee shop" value="<%=val(request,"title")%>"></div><div class="field"><label for="new-category">Choose a category</label><select id="new-category" name="category" required><option value="">Select a category</option><% for(String c:(String[])request.getAttribute("categories")){ %><option <%=c.equals(request.getParameter("category"))?"selected":""%>><%=e(c)%></option><% } %></select></div><div class="field"><label for="description">Tell freelancers what you need</label><textarea id="description" name="description" minlength="30" maxlength="850" rows="7" required placeholder="The goal, the deliverables, and anything that would help someone write a great pitch…" aria-describedby="brief-hint"><%=val(request,"description")%></textarea><div class="field-hint" id="brief-hint"><span>30–850 characters. Clear beats long.</span><span data-count-for="description">0 / 850</span></div></div><div class="two-columns"><div class="field"><label for="budget">Maximum budget (INR)</label><input id="budget" name="budget" type="number" min="1" max="100000000" step="0.01" required placeholder="25000" value="<%=val(request,"budget")%>"></div><div class="field"><label for="urgency">When would you like to start?</label><select id="urgency" name="urgency" required><% for(String t:(String[])request.getAttribute("timelines")){ %><option <%=t.equals(request.getParameter("urgency"))?"selected":""%>><%=e(t)%></option><% } %></select></div></div><p class="quiet">Publishing makes your brief visible to everyone. You can close it before accepting a pitch.</p><div class="form-actions"><button type="submit">Publish project <%=arrow()%></button><a href="<%=base%>/app/dashboard">Cancel</a></div><p class="draft-status quiet" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section>

<% } else if(view.equals("project")){ ServiceRequest p=(ServiceRequest)request.getAttribute("project"); boolean owner=Boolean.TRUE.equals(request.getAttribute("owner")); List<Proposal> pitches=(List<Proposal>)request.getAttribute("pitches"); boolean pending=pitches.stream().anyMatch(x->x.status()==ProposalStatus.PENDING); %>
<section class="container section"><a class="back-link" href="<%=base%>/<%=owner?"app/dashboard":"explore"%>">Back to <%=owner?"workspace":"projects"%></a><div class="project-detail-layout"><div><div class="detail-tags"><span class="tag"><%=e(p.category())%></span><span class="badge <%=p.status().name().toLowerCase()%>"><%=stateLabel(p.status())%></span></div><h1 class="project-title"><%=e(p.title())%></h1><div class="client-line"><span class="avatar"><%=e(p.customerName().substring(0,1))%></span><div><strong><%=e(p.customerName())%></strong><span class="quiet">Posted <%=p.createdAt().toLocalDate()%></span></div></div><div class="project-brief"><h2>The brief</h2><p class="preserve-lines"><%=e(p.brief())%></p></div>
<% if(owner && (p.status()==RequestStatus.OPEN||p.status()==RequestStatus.BOOKED)){ %><form method="post" action="<%=base%>/app/action/<%=p.status()==RequestStatus.OPEN?"cancel":"complete"%>" data-confirm="<%=p.status()==RequestStatus.OPEN?"Close this project and decline pending pitches?":"Mark this project as completed? Confirm the agreed work has been delivered first."%>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=e(token)%>"><input type="hidden" name="requestId" value="<%=p.id()%>"><button class="secondary" type="submit"><%=p.status()==RequestStatus.OPEN?"Close project":"Mark work as completed"%></button></form><% } %>
<% if(viewer!=null){ %><section class="pitches-section"><h2><%=owner?"Compare your pitches":"Your pitch"%> <span class="quiet">(<%=pitches.size()%>)</span></h2><p class="quiet"><%=owner?"Compare scope, quote, and delivery. The lowest price isn't always the best fit.":"Your offer is private to you and this project's client."%></p><% if(pitches.isEmpty()){ %><div class="empty-state small-empty"><h3><%=owner?"Give good ideas a little room.":"Bring your perspective."%></h3><p><%=owner?"New pitches will appear here. You can share this project's URL with freelancers.":"Read the brief and tell the client how you would approach it."%></p></div><% } %><div class="pitch-comparison"><% for(Proposal offer:pitches){ %><article class="offer"><div class="offer-header"><div class="avatar lilac"><%=e(offer.providerName().substring(0,1))%></div><div><h3><%=e(offer.providerName())%></h3><span class="quiet"><%=e(offer.status().name().toLowerCase())%></span></div></div><p class="preserve-lines"><%=e(offer.diagnosis())%></p><dl class="offer-terms"><div><dt>Fixed quote</dt><dd><%=money(offer.price())%></dd></div><div><dt>Delivery</dt><dd><%=offer.etaDays()%> days</dd></div><div><dt>Support</dt><dd><%=offer.warrantyDays()%> days</dd></div></dl>
<% if(owner && p.status()==RequestStatus.OPEN && offer.status()==ProposalStatus.PENDING){ %><form method="post" action="<%=base%>/app/action/accept" data-confirm="Accept this pitch? Other pending pitches will be declined. No payment will be collected."><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=e(token)%>"><input type="hidden" name="requestId" value="<%=p.id()%>"><input type="hidden" name="proposalId" value="<%=offer.id()%>"><label for="date-<%=offer.id()%>">Agreed start date</label><input id="date-<%=offer.id()%>" type="date" name="date" min="<%=LocalDate.now()%>" max="<%=LocalDate.now().plusYears(1)%>" required><button class="full" type="submit">Choose <%=e(offer.providerName().split(" ")[0])%> <%=arrow()%></button></form><% } else if(!owner && offer.status()==ProposalStatus.PENDING){ %><form method="post" action="<%=base%>/app/action/withdraw" data-confirm="Withdraw your pitch from this project?"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=e(token)%>"><input type="hidden" name="requestId" value="<%=p.id()%>"><input type="hidden" name="proposalId" value="<%=offer.id()%>"><button class="text-button" type="submit">Withdraw pitch</button></form><% } %></article><% } %></div></section><% } %></div>
<aside class="project-sidebar"><div class="budget-panel"><span>Project budget</span><strong><%=money(p.budget())%></strong><p>Fixed price · INR</p><hr><dl><div><dt>Ready to start</dt><dd><%=e(p.urgency())%></dd></div><div><dt>Working style</dt><dd>Remote friendly</dd></div><div><dt>Project reference</dt><dd>#<%=p.id()%></dd></div></dl></div>
<% if(viewer==null){ %><div class="sidebar-note"><h3>Sounds like your kind of project?</h3><p>Join as a freelancer to send the client a thoughtful pitch.</p><a class="button full" href="<%=base%>/register?role=PROVIDER">Join to pitch <%=arrow()%></a><a class="underlink" href="<%=base%>/login">Already a member? Log in</a></div><% } else if(!owner && viewer.role()==Role.PROVIDER && p.status()==RequestStatus.OPEN && !pending){ %><form class="pitch-form" method="post" action="<%=base%>/app/action/proposal"><h2>Make your pitch.</h2><% if(!Boolean.TRUE.equals(request.getAttribute("canPitch"))){ %><p class="alert error">Your bidding permission is paused. An administrator can restore it.</p><% } %><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=e(token)%>"><input type="hidden" name="requestId" value="<%=p.id()%>"><div class="field"><label for="diagnosis">Your approach & deliverables</label><textarea id="diagnosis" name="diagnosis" minlength="12" maxlength="1000" required rows="5" placeholder="What will you deliver, and how will you make it happen?"><%=val(request,"diagnosis")%></textarea></div><div class="field"><label for="price">Your fixed quote (INR)</label><input id="price" type="number" min="1" max="100000000" step="0.01" name="price" required value="<%=val(request,"price")%>"></div><div class="two-columns"><div class="field"><label for="etaDays">Delivery (days)</label><input id="etaDays" type="number" min="1" max="365" name="etaDays" required value="<%=val(request,"etaDays")%>"></div><div class="field"><label for="warrantyDays">Support (days)</label><input id="warrantyDays" type="number" min="1" max="365" name="warrantyDays" required value="<%=val(request,"warrantyDays")%>"></div></div><p class="quiet">Include revisions and exclusions in your approach. Support is time available for agreed follow-up fixes.</p><button class="full" type="submit" <%=Boolean.TRUE.equals(request.getAttribute("canPitch"))?"":"disabled"%>>Send my pitch <%=arrow()%></button></form><% } else { %><div class="sidebar-note"><h3><%=owner?"You're in the driver's seat.":"Keep everything clear."%></h3><p><%=owner?"Review each approach carefully before choosing. Accepting creates a project record; payments are arranged outside this release.":"Check your workspace for the status of your pitch and agreed project details."%></p></div><% } %></aside></div></section>

<% } else if(view.equals("access")){ List<UserAccount> accounts=(List<UserAccount>)request.getAttribute("accounts"); Map<Long,Set<Permission>> revocations=(Map<Long,Set<Permission>>)request.getAttribute("revocations"); List<AuditEvent> events=(List<AuditEvent>)request.getAttribute("events"); %>
<section class="container section"><div class="page-heading"><h1>Manage account access.</h1><p>Review account permissions and recent administrative activity.</p></div><h2>Account permissions</h2><p class="quiet">Access controls for up to 100 accounts. Admin privileges cannot be changed here.</p><div class="access-list"><% for(UserAccount account:accounts){ if(account.role()==Role.ADMIN) continue; %><article class="access-row"><div><h3><%=e(account.displayName())%></h3><span class="quiet"><%=e(account.username())%> · <%=roleLabel(account.role())%></span><p class="quiet">Audit subject: <code>dibsly:user:<%=account.id()%></code></p><p><% if(revocations.get(account.id()).isEmpty()){ %><span class="status-text">All role permissions active</span><% } else { %><strong>Revoked:</strong> <%=e(revocations.get(account.id()))%><% } %></p></div><form method="post" action="<%=base%>/app/action/permission"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=e(token)%>"><input type="hidden" name="userId" value="<%=account.id()%>"><div><label for="permission-<%=account.id()%>">Permission</label><select id="permission-<%=account.id()%>" name="permission"><% for(Permission perm:account.role().permissions()){ %><option><%=perm%></option><% } %></select></div><div><label for="change-<%=account.id()%>">Change</label><select id="change-<%=account.id()%>" name="change"><option value="revoke">Revoke</option><option value="restore">Restore</option></select></div><button type="submit">Apply</button></form></article><% } %></div><div class="section-heading"><h2>Account activity</h2><a class="underlink" href="<%=base%>/app/access">Refresh activity</a></div><div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label="Account activity"><table><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Account</th><th>Action</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(AuditEvent event:events){ %><tr><td><%=e(event.time())%></td><td><%=e(event.actor())%></td><td><%=e(event.action())%></td><td><%=e(event.detail())%></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table><% if(events.isEmpty()){ %><p class="empty-state">Account activity will appear here.</p><% } %></div></section>

<% } else if(view.equals("guide")){ %>
<section class="container section guide"><h1>Good work starts<br>with a good fit.</h1><p class="lede">Dibsly turns “I need someone” into a clear choice between thoughtful approaches.</p><div class="guide-columns"><article><h2>Find the right freelancer for your idea.</h2><ol><li><strong>Write your brief.</strong> Explain the outcome, deliverables, budget, and when you want to start.</li><li><strong>Compare private pitches.</strong> Read each approach alongside its quote, delivery time, and included support.</li><li><strong>Agree and begin.</strong> Accept a pitch with a start date. Mark the project complete once the work is delivered.</li></ol><a class="button" href="<%=base%>/register?role=CUSTOMER">Join as a client</a></article><article><h2>Find freelance work that fits your approach.</h2><ol><li><strong>Find a brief you believe in.</strong> Filter by category or search for the work you enjoy.</li><li><strong>Pitch a clear plan.</strong> Include the deliverables, revisions, exclusions, fixed quote, and timeline.</li><li><strong>Keep track of your work.</strong> Your workspace records pending pitches and accepted projects.</li></ol><a class="button secondary" href="<%=base%>/register?role=PROVIDER">Join as a freelancer</a></article></div><div class="faq"><h2>A few things to know.</h2><details open><summary>Does Dibsly collect payments?</summary><p>No. This release records quotes and agreements but does not collect payments, hold escrow, or provide payment protection. Arrange any payment separately with your collaborator.</p></details><details><summary>Who can see my pitch?</summary><p>The client who owns the project, you, and administrators. Other freelancers cannot view your offer.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change my mind?</summary><p>Freelancers can withdraw a pending pitch and submit a new one. Clients can close an open project. Accepting a pitch declines other pending offers and creates a contract record.</p></details><details><summary>Are the people and projects on the demo real?</summary><p>When the demo banner is visible, the seeded people and briefs are fictional examples. Production starts without those demo accounts or projects.</p></details><details><summary>What makes a helpful brief?</summary><p>Describe the result you want, list deliverables, share useful constraints, and set a realistic budget and start window. Keep confidential information out of public briefs.</p></details></div></section>
<% } else if(view.equals("error")){ %><section class="container empty-state error-page"><h1>Let's get you back on track.</h1><p>The action wasn't completed. Check your access or return to your workspace.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="<%=base%>/app/dashboard">Go to workspace</a><a class="underlink" href="<%=base%>/explore">Explore projects</a></div></section><% } %>
</main><%@ include file="footer.jspf" %>
